      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……悲しんでいる暇はない。\r\n二人のためにも先を急ぐんだ。",
        "official_en": "There is no time for tears. The best way to honor them is to press on now.",
        "real_en": "...We don't have time to grieve. We have to hurry on, for their sake too."
      },
      "review": {
