        "official_en_sha256": "c2e94684afe14fdd9fa62a9ac0cac0e1dd09bd2eccec459cd014f92868c7ef79"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "罪を償えたとは思っていません……。\r\nですが、少しでも力になれたのなら……。",
        "official_en": "I have not atoned for my past yet. I merely hope my efforts...",
        "real_en": "I don't believe I've fully atoned for my sins... But if I was able to help, even a little..."
