        "official_en_sha256": "9b7581811f2032fee42499094773e225cb799498f2496fdcfb49fef5508d9abf"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "謝ることはありません。\r\nあなたの償い……。\r\n確かに受け取りました。",
        "official_en": "You need not apologize... I acknowledge your redemption.",
        "real_en": "You don't need to apologize. I accept what you've done to make amends."
