      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "７００年以上生きていたのに……私は未熟だった……。\r\nお前たちはとっくの昔に……。\r\n大人になっていたのだな……。",
        "official_en": "In spite of living for seven hundred years...I was still so callow... You two were the wise ones all along.",
        "real_en": "I lived for more than seven hundred years... and I was still immature... You two had grown up... long ago..."
